<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Trust target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Trust target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman analyst Raphael Soifer said he raised the 1997 EPS view on U.S. Trust Corp to $4.20 from $4.10, and raised 12-month price target to upper 80's</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimate for 1996 unchanged at $3.75/shr</p>
<p>-- Analyst says share target based on multiple of 21 times earnings expected in 12 months</p>
<p>-- Analyst says U.S. Trust's Q3 of $0.97/shr exceeded his $0.94 estimate</p>
<p>-- Rating remains outperform/buy</p>
<p>-- U.S. Trust closed Thursday at 61-1/4.</p>
</text>
